              "text": "ठेका धरणे (ṭhekā dharṇe) is ठेका, inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi ṭhekā, \"mode of beating a drum\", under ṭhēkk, \"fix\" (CDIAL 5509), with धरणे, \"to hold\"."
